<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <h1 style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>Aposemat IoT-23</strong></h1><h2 style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>A labeled dataset with malicious and benign IoT network traffic </em></h2><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><br></p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>This dataset was created as part of the Avast AIC laboratory with the funding of Avast Software</em> </p><h1 style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>Citation</strong></h1>
