<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class=""><strong>Table 2: Breakdown of Application Layer Protocols as detected by Zeek on the Malicious Scenarios.</strong></p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><br></p><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>IoT benign flows dataset tables</strong></h2><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">In this section we show tables with the network information for the bening scenarios. These scenarios had been created by capturing network traffic data of not infected real IoT devices. The column with the malware name was changed to specify the device name.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The bening scenarios are obtained by capturing the network traffic of real IoT devices. It's important to see and understand how real IoT devices behave in the network when they are not infected. This will allow us to identify a change in the behavior when they are infected with malware or are under attack.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Table 3 shows the network data for each one of the bening scenarios, including information regarding the duration, number of packets, number of Zeek flows, pcap file and the name of the device. Table 4 shows the application layer detected protocols for each one of the bening scenarios. </p>
</div>

























</div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-image image-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.imageLayout/9be94a40-718a-48e9-bf33-9139cab3f24d_289/website.components.imageLayout.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.imageLayout/9be94a40-718a-48e9-bf33-9139cab3f24d_289/website.components.imageLayout.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.imageLayout" data-sqsp-block="image-classic" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1620490057495_210597" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1620490057495_210597"><div class="sqs-block-content">




























